config SND_ENS1371
    tristate "Ensoniq ES1371 AudioPCI playback"
    depends on SND
    default y
    help
      Native legacy OSS playback for Ensoniq 1274:1371 AudioPCI controllers.
      With M, build es1371.ko for this kernel. Its 32-bit DMA pool and fallible
      STOP keep hardware resources owned until a safe unload can complete.
